    "body": "## Problem\n\nWith UI2 enabled, substitute confirmation loses its match highlight when `hlsearch` is disabled. UI2's prompt-buffer updates currently clear the transient match highlight for the current editing buffer.\n\n## Solution\n\nOnly clear the transient match highlight when the current buffer changes, so UI2 updates to its own prompt buffer preserve the confirmation highlight.\n\nFixes #41039.\n\nValidation: `zig build`; `test/functional/ui/cmdline2_spec.lua` (14 tests); `git diff --check`.",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-03T13:48:34Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Backport failed for `release-0.12`, because it was unable to cherry-pick the commit(s).\n\nPlease cherry-pick the changes locally and resolve any conflicts.\n```bash\ngit fetch origin release-0.12\ngit worktree add -d .worktree/backport-41067-to-release-0.12 origin/release-0.12\ncd .worktree/backport-41067-to-release-0.12\ngit switch --create backport-41067-to-release-0.12\ngit cherry-pick -x 6538d0aadb32625e2d6969c835ebd061cad8a780\n```",
